# crossmodule.tkr — the project-regressor for the `package` (`.tkl`) artifact kind (0.3.1
# regressor-principal §4 item 2). Proves the full cross-module const chain end to end
# (serialize -> .tkl -> deserialize -> seed_from_dep -> inline_consts -> lower -> run) via the
# `Background: Given dependency` runner crumb (C4): the `dep/` sub-project (`kind = "package"`,
# exports `pub const P` and `exp const Q`) is built to a `.tkl`, provisioned into a scratch
# `packages/`, and this project's own root is built against it.

Feature: crossmodule — package artifact + cross-module const resolution

  Background:
    Given dependency = "dep"

  Scenario: the consumer resolves a bare pub const and a qualified exp const from its dependency
    When built and run
